# opp-engine — frontend environment configuration
#
# VITE_API_BASE: the opportunities Edge Function base URL, WITHOUT a trailing slash.
# Example: https://jqfodlzcsgfocyuawzyx.functions.supabase.co/opportunities
VITE_API_BASE=

# VITE_OPERATOR_TOKEN: shared operator bearer token. Sent as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
# on every request. See docs/auth-migration.md in the repo root for the multi-operator
# migration path — this app only ever talks to the Edge Function, never Supabase directly.
VITE_OPERATOR_TOKEN=
